  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NMS-Malagasy Integrated Rural Development Program (phase II)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1)Adults or youth without basic skills (in reading and writing and/or mathematics) who successfully gain literacy skills through the education offered and passed the exam. 2) The training of and cooperation with the parent associations (at the primary schools) is one of the main strategies for increasing the number of children that go to school (and decreasing the drop-out rate).</narrative>
  </description>
